  "doc": "Slice 4a, chancy (1,000 seeds), the library Effects that turn on crits and evades: Drumbeat (counters), Echo (free hits of the same type), Edge Returns the Breath, Opening Cut, Phantom Dodge (emit), Scatter Gale, Wind at Your Back.",
  "a": {
